sh from Cinema 4D (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from houdini (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-houdini\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-houdini-beta-2\">Publish from Houdini (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from solidworks (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-solidworks\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-solidworks-beta-2\">Publish from SolidWorks (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from spline, and figma (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-spline\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-spline-and-figma-beta-2\">Publish from Spline, and Figma (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"camera paths and default walkthroughs\" href=\"/docs/guides/camera-paths\" id=\"lnk-camera-paths-and-default-walkthroughs-2\">Camera paths and default walkthroughs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"hotspots and doors\" href=\"/docs/guides/hotspots-and-doors\" id=\"lnk-hotspots-and-doors-2\">Hotspots and doors</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse capture: film a room (beta)\" href=\"/docs/guides/film-a-room\" id=\"lnk-verse-capture-film-a-room-beta-2\">Verse Capture: film a room (beta)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse play: host a web game\" href=\"/docs/guides/host-a-web-game\" id=\"lnk-verse-play-host-a-web-game-2\">Verse Play: host a web game</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"spatial bench\" href=\"/docs/guides/spatial-bench\" id=\"lnk-spatial-bench-2\">Spatial Bench</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"light and dark theme\" href=\"/docs/guides/light-and-dark-theme\" id=\"lnk-light-and-dark-theme-2\">Light and dark theme</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"share privately with tokens\" href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-2\">Share privately with tokens</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"show your clients who looked\" href=\"/docs/guides/analytics\" id=\"lnk-show-your-clients-who-looked-2\">Show your clients who looked</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed anywhere: wordpress, shopify, webflow\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-anywhere\" id=\"lnk-embed-anywhere-wordpress-shopify-webflow-2\">Embed anywhere: WordPress, Shopify, Webflow</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse for commerce: 3d on product pages (woocommerce, magento, bigcommerce, salesforce)\" href=\"/docs/guides/commerce\" id=\"lnk-verse-for-commerce-3d-on-product-pages-w-2\">Verse for Commerce: 3D on product pages (WooCommerce, Magento, BigCommerce, Salesforce)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse links and embeds: embed the viewer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-the-viewer\" id=\"lnk-verse-links-and-embeds-embed-the-viewer-2\">Verse links and embeds: embed the viewer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"export a flythrough video\" href=\"/docs/guides/export-video\" id=\"lnk-export-a-flythrough-video-2\">Export a flythrough video</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"collect client review comments\" href=\"/docs/guides/collect-review-comments\" id=\"lnk-collect-client-review-comments-2\">Collect client review comments</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"author a guided tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/author-a-guided-tour\" id=\"lnk-author-a-guided-tour-2\">Author a guided tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"video on surfaces, sound in the room\" href=\"/docs/guides/video-and-audio\" id=\"lnk-video-on-surfaces-sound-in-the-room-2\">Video on surfaces, sound in the room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"publish from ifc or usd\" href=\"/docs/guides/publish-from-ifc\" id=\"lnk-publish-from-ifc-or-usd-2\">Publish from IFC or USD</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"upload fbx and obj\" href=\"/docs/guides/upload-fbx-obj\" id=\"lnk-upload-fbx-and-obj-2\">Upload FBX and OBJ</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"build a configurator\" href=\"/docs/guides/build-a-configurator\" id=\"lnk-build-a-configurator-2\">Build a configurator</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"present a scene to a room\" href=\"/docs/guides/present-a-scene\" id=\"lnk-present-a-scene-to-a-room-2\">Present a scene to a room</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse-prepare: the local compression step\" href=\"/docs/guides/verse-prepare\" id=\"lnk-verse-prepare-the-local-compression-step-2\">verse-prepare: the local compression step</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"tune quality knobs\" href=\"/docs/guides/tune-quality\" id=\"lnk-tune-quality-knobs-2\">Tune quality knobs</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"run your own server\" href=\"/docs/guides/run-your-own-server\" id=\"lnk-run-your-own-server-2\">Run your own server</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"monitor production\" href=\"/docs/guides/monitor-production\" id=\"lnk-monitor-production-2\">Monitor production</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"ask verse, the site assistant\" href=\"/docs/guides/ask-verse\" id=\"lnk-ask-verse-the-site-assistant-2\">Ask Verse, the site assistant</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: floor plan to 3d home\" href=\"/docs/guides/floor-plan-to-3d\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-floor-plan-to-3d-home-2\">Verse Home: floor plan to 3D home</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour\" href=\"/docs/guides/instant-home\" id=\"lnk-verse-home-plan-to-a-home-buyers-walk-re-2\">Verse Home: plan to a home buyers walk, restyle and tour</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page\" href=\"/docs/guides/web-component\" id=\"lnk-one-tag-any-page-2\">&lt;verse-viewer&gt;: one tag, any page</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"designer tools: framer, webflow, figma\" href=\"/docs/guides/designer-tools\" id=\"lnk-designer-tools-framer-webflow-figma-2\">Designer tools: Framer, Webflow, Figma</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"react and vue wrappers\" href=\"/docs/guides/react-and-vue\" id=\"lnk-react-and-vue-wrappers-2\">React and Vue wrappers</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"rest client round trip\" href=\"/docs/guides/rest-client\" id=\"lnk-rest-client-round-trip-2\">REST client round trip</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with woocommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-woocommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-woocommerce-2\">Sell with WooCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with bigcommerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-bigcommerce\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-bigcommerce-2\">Sell with BigCommerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"sell with magento / adobe commerce\" href=\"/docs/guides/sell-with-magento\" id=\"lnk-sell-with-magento-adobe-commerce-2\">Sell with Magento / Adobe Commerce</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in wix\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-wix\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-wix-2\">Embed in Wix</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in squarespace\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-squarespace\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-squarespace-2\">Embed in Squarespace</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in framer\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-framer\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-framer-2\">Embed in Framer</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed in ghost and hubspot\" href=\"/docs/guides/embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot\" id=\"lnk-embed-in-ghost-and-hubspot-2\">Embed in Ghost and HubSpot</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with zapier\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-zapier\" aria-current=\"page\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-zapier-2\">Automate with Zapier</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with make\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-make\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-make-2\">Automate with Make</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"automate with n8n\" href=\"/docs/guides/automate-with-n8n\" id=\"lnk-automate-with-n8n-2\">Automate with n8n</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-10\"><h2>Blog & updates</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"all posts\" href=\"/docs/blog/index\" id=\"lnk-all-posts-2\">All posts</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"how verse streams a building\" href=\"/docs/blog/how-verse-streams-a-building\" id=\"lnk-how-verse-streams-a-building-2\">How Verse streams a building</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.7: what's new for you\" href=\"/docs/blog/verse-engine-2-7-whats-new\" id=\"lnk-2-7-what-s-new-for-you-2\">2.7: what's new for you</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"2.0 release notes for humans\" href=\"/docs/blog/2-0-release-notes-for-humans\" id=\"lnk-2-0-release-notes-for-humans-2\">2.0 release notes for humans</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-11\"><h2>Integrations</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"integrations: every platform at a glance\" href=\"/docs/integrations\" id=\"lnk-integrations-every-platform-at-a-glance-2\">Integrations: every platform at a glance</a></section><section id=\"sec-item-12\"><h2>API & SDK</h2><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api, sdk and mcp: embed, sdk, webhooks\" href=\"/docs/developers\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-sdk-and-mcp-embed-sdk-webhooks-2\">Verse API, SDK and MCP: embed, SDK, webhooks</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse api reference\" href=\"/docs/api\" id=\"lnk-verse-api-reference-2\">Verse API reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api quickstart\" href=\"/docs/api-quickstart\" id=\"lnk-api-quickstart-2\">API quickstart</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"api changelog\" href=\"/docs/api-changelog\" id=\"lnk-api-changelog-2\">API changelog</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"embed sdk reference\" href=\"/docs/embed-sdk\" id=\"lnk-embed-sdk-reference-2\">Embed SDK reference</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse sdk: js / ts (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)\" href=\"/docs/sdk\" id=\"lnk-verse-sdk-js-ts-ctruhtech-verse-sdk-2\">Verse SDK: JS / TS (@ctruhtech/verse-sdk)</a><a data-doc-item data-doc-title=\"verse mcp server for ai agents\" href=\"/docs/mcp\" id=\"lnk-verse-mcp-server-for-ai-agents-2\">Verse MCP server for AI agents</a></section><p class=\"docs-no-results\" hidden>No matching guides.</p></div></nav></aside><div class=\"doc-body\"><article class=\"doc-article\" id=\"art-doc-article\"><h1 id=\"automate-verse-with-zapier\">Automate Verse with Zapier<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#automate-verse-with-zapier\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section\">#</a></h1>\n<p><strong>Status:</strong> the app is validated against the Zapier platform schema and\n<code>zapier validate</code> (local), and its triggers and actions are exercised\nagainst a mock server — it is <strong>not yet published</strong> to Zapier&#39;s app\ndirectory. Until it is, it runs as a private integration you are invited\nto; the source is <code>integrations/automation/zapier/</code> in the repo.</p>\n<p>When a scene finishes compiling, a client pins a review comment, or a\ncompile fails, Zapier can post to Slack, drop a row in a sheet, or mail\nthe share link — without any code on your side. Going the other way, a\nZap can hand Verse a file link from Dropbox or Drive and get a scene back.</p>\n<p><strong>You need:</strong> a Verse account token (see\n<a href=\"/docs/guides/share-privately#1-get-an-account-and-own-the-scene\" id=\"lnk-share-privately-with-tokens-3\">Share privately with tokens</a>)\nand a Zapier account.</p>\n<h2 id=\"1-connect-your-account\">1. Connect your account<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#1-connect-your-account\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-2\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Add the <strong>Verse Engine</strong> app to a Zap. Zapier asks for two things:</p>\n<ul><li><strong>Verse server</strong> — the origin your account lives on (prefilled with the\npublic host; self-hosters paste their own).</li><li><strong>Account token</strong> — the 64-hex token from <code>POST /v1/account</code> or <code>/studio</code>.</li></ul>\n<p>Zapier tests the connection with <code>GET /v1/account</code> and labels it with your\naccount name.</p>\n<h2 id=\"2-triggers-and-actions\">2. Triggers and actions<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#2-triggers-and-actions\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-3\">#</a></h2>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead><tr><th></th><th>Name</th><th>What it does</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Trigger</td><td><strong>New Scene Ready</strong></td><td>Fires when an upload you own finishes: <code>job</code> (the scene id), <code>url</code> (the share link), <code>vpkUrl</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Trigger</td><td><strong>Scene Failed</strong></td><td>Fires when a compile fails: <code>job</code>, the friendly <code>error</code> and its <code>code</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Trigger</td><td><strong>New Review Comment</strong></td><td>Fires when a reviewer pins a comment: <code>scene</code>, <code>comment.text</code>, <code>comment.author</code>, <code>comment.pos</code>.</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td><strong>Upload Model From URL</strong></td><td>Hands Verse a public file link (GLB, IFC, USD, FBX/OBJ zip, splat, point cloud); returns the <code>job</code> id and the share link it will have.</td></tr><tr><td>Action</td><td><strong>Create Share Link</strong></td><td>Mints a tokened link for a scene you own — what opens a private scene.</td></tr><tr><td>Search</td><td><strong>Get Scene Analytics</strong></td><td>Views, unique viewers, time spent, funnel and rooms over the last 7, 30 or 90 days.</td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<p>The triggers are <strong>instant</strong>: turning a Zap on registers a webhook on your\naccount (<code>POST /v1/account/webhooks</code>, one event each); turning it off\ndeletes it. Nothing polls.</p>\n<h2 id=\"3-worked-example-new-scene-slack\">3. Worked example: new scene → Slack<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#3-worked-example-new-scene-slack\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-4\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li><strong>Trigger:</strong> Verse Engine → <em>New Scene Ready</em>. Zapier loads your\nexisting scenes as sample data so you can map fields before the first\nreal upload.</li><li><strong>Action:</strong> Slack → <em>Send Channel Message</em>. Message:\n<div class=\"doc-code\"><div><span>Code</span><button type=\"button\" data-copy-local id=\"btn-copy\">Copy ⧉</button></div><pre><code>New scene ready: {{job}}\n{{url}}</code></pre></div></li><li>Turn the Zap on. The next upload you own (from <code>/app</code>, the Blender\nadd-on, or the action below) posts its link the moment the compile\nfinishes.</li></ol>\n<h2 id=\"4-worked-example-dropbox-file-verse-scene\">4. Worked example: Dropbox file → Verse scene<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#4-worked-example-dropbox-file-verse-scene\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-5\">#</a></h2>\n<ol><li><strong>Trigger:</strong> Dropbox → <em>New File in Folder</em> (a <code>publish/</code> folder).</li><li><strong>Action:</strong> Verse Engine → <em>Upload Model From URL</em>. <strong>File URL:</strong>\nDropbox&#39;s <em>Direct Media Link</em> (or a shared link with <code>dl=1</code>). **Scene\nname:** the file name without extension.</li><li>The action returns <code>job</code>; the scene is live when a <em>New Scene Ready</em>\nZap fires for it, or when <code>GET /v1/ingest/&lt;job&gt;</code> says <code>status: done</code>.</li></ol>\n<p>Uploads count against your account&#39;s ingest rate (20 per hour per token)\nand the same 512 MB cap as a direct upload; the server fetches the file\nitself, so the link must be public and direct.</p>\n<h2 id=\"the-same-thing-over-http\">The same thing over HTTP<a class=\"anchor\" href=\"#the-same-thing-over-http\" aria-label=\"Link to this section\" id=\"lnk-link-to-this-section-6\">#</a></h2>\n<p>Everything the app does is a documented call: subscribe with\n<a href=\"/docs/api#webhooks-2-7\" id=\"lnk-post-v1-account-webhooks\"><code>POST /v1/account/webhooks</code></a>, upload with\n<code>POST /v1/ingest/url</code> <code>{ &quot;url&quot;: &quot;https://…/model.glb&quot;, &quot;name&quot;: &quot;flat&quot; }</code>,\nmint a link with <a href=\"/docs/api#scenes\" id=\"lnk-post-v1-scenes-share\"><code>POST /v1/scenes/&lt;id&gt;/share</code></a>. A\nZapier <em>Webhooks by Zapier</em> step can do the same if you prefer not to\nwait for the directory listing.</p></article><div class=\"doc-source\">Published documentation from <a href=\"https://verse.ctruh.com/docs/#/guides/automate-with-zapier\" id=\"lnk-verse-by-ctruh\">Verse by Ctruh</a></div></div><aside class=\"docs-toc\" id=\"asd-docs-toc\"><p>ON THIS PAGE</p><a href=\"#1-connect-your-account\" id=\"lnk-1-connect-your-account\">1. Connect your account</a><a href=\"#2-triggers-and-actions\" id=\"lnk-2-triggers-and-actions\">2. Triggers and actions</a><a href=\"#3-worked-example-new-scene-slack\" id=\"lnk-3-worked-example-new-scene-slack\">3. Worked example: new scene → Slack</a><a href=\"#4-worked-example-dropbox-file-verse-scene\" id=\"lnk-4-worked-example-dropbox-file-verse-scen\">4. Worked example: Dropbox file → Verse scene</a><a href=\"#the-same-thing-over-http\" id=\"lnk-the-same-thing-over-http\">The same thing over HTTP</a></aside></section>"}